  "message": "test(l8): chot danh tinh mien doi so cua bo sinh, phan chung tung bo, doi chung a131 (#1539, review ma luot 3)\n\nR3-01: kiem_bo_sinh ghi lai cac bo doi so da kiem va so voi tap (cam, bo_loai)\ndoc bang AST tu chinh cac loi goi bo sinh trong cac ca cua dot A (doc lap voi\nBO_SINH_MONG), dung nam bo. a136 them nam bo sinh gia moi cai chi sai tai dung\nmot bo, va BO_SINH_MONG bi bo / lap / thay mot bo hoac cac ca dung sau bo.\nR3-02: c40 them doi chung a131 nguyen ven (ca khong goi bo sinh) de nhanh\n`if tru is not None` khong roi vao loi vo can.\nR3-03: a135 va a136 dung chung bo nho dem ket qua bo sinh that, khoa theo chinh\ndoi tuong ham nen bo sinh gia cua a136 khong bi che.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015GtxrabSZAwhhMamwUmUFW",
